<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Adsteam Marine share offer to close early.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Adsteam Marine share offer to close early.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Residual Assco Group Ltd, formerly Adelaide Steamship Co Ltd, said on Monday that the share offer for its Adsteam Marine Ltd division was oversubscribed and the offer would close early later on Monday.</p>
<p>The offer had been due to close in the first week of June.</p>
</text>
